asianews.com\/login\/\">Login<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-login-form-wrap\">\n      <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Landmark deal is a key milestone in the development of Hong Kong&#8217;s ILS market. <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":10954,"featured_media":230980,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"companies_category":[405],"subject":[234],"line_of_business":[],"topic":[],"coauthors":[877],"class_list":["post-230972","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","industry_segments-reinsurers","country-hong-kong","companies_category-picc-property-and-casualty","subject-ils"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.6 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Hong Kong\u2019s first sidecar raises US$12m for PICC P&amp;C<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"The key resource for accurate, insightful and reliable coverage of Asia\u2019s insurance and reinsurance market.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/picc-pc-raises-us12m-from-first-hong-kong-domiciled-sidecar\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Hong Kong\u2019s first sidecar raises US$12m for PICC P&amp;C\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The key resource for accurate, insightful and reliable coverage of Asia\u2019s insurance and reinsurance market.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/picc-pc-raises-us12m-from-first-hong-kong-domiciled-sidecar\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"InsuranceAsia