sia News platform, please enquire about a subscription.<\/p>\n<p>Your company may already have a corporate license in place.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mepr-button-wrap\">\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/subscribe\/\">Enquire Now<\/a><\/p>\n<div>OR<\/div>\n<p>      <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/register\/free-trial\/\" class=\"mepr_product_link mepr-product-link-63661\">Take a Free Trial<\/a>\n        <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Already a Subscriber? Please <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/login\/\">Login<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-login-form-wrap\">\n      <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>In a public benefits application to the competition regulator, the insurer also offered to address the availability of RACI home insurance in northern Western Australia and to invest US$14 million in community resilience over the next decade.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6035,"featured_media":199169,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"companies_category":[298,490],"subject":[254,67],"line_of_business":[],"topic":[],"coauthors":[534],"class_list":["post-230944","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","industry_segments-insurers","industry_segments-regulators","country-australia","companies_category-iag","companies_category-rac-insurance","subject-legal","subject-ma"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.6 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>IAG offers to trade NRMA Western Australia renewal rights for RACI deal approval<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"The key resource for accurate, insightful and reliable coverage of Asia\u2019s insurance and reinsurance market.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-prev