72"},"modified":"2026-10-14T10:34:54","modified_gmt":"2026-10-14T02:34:54","slug":"howden-australia-drafts-marsh-team-for-sport-and-entertainment-practice-build-out","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/howden-australia-drafts-marsh-team-for-sport-and-entertainment-practice-build-out\/","title":{"rendered":"Howden Australia drafts Marsh team for sport, entertainment practice build-out"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"mp_wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-excerpt\">\n    <p>Howden Australia has added five senior ex-Marsh brokers to grow its sport and entertainment practice, which it called \"a significant investment in the sector.\"\nSimon Calabrese (pictured) has been appo...<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-message\">\n    <div class=\"mepr-wrapper\">\n<p>To continue reading the full article and get full access to the InsuranceAsia News platform, please enquire about a subscription.<\/p>\n<p>Your company may already have a corporate license in place.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mepr-button-wrap\">\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/subscribe\/\">Enquire Now<\/a><\/p>\n<div>OR<\/div>\n<p>      <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/register\/free-trial\/\" class=\"mepr_product_link mepr-product-link-63661\">Take a Free Trial<\/a>\n        <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Already a Subscriber? Please <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/login\/\">Login<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-login-form-wrap\">\n      <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>&#8216;In a significant investment in the sector&#8217;, the broker appoints Simon Calabrese as head of entertainment and leisure, while four other former Marsh employees join as senior associates.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9598,"featured_media":230873,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnot