:27:47","modified_gmt":"2026-10-13T07:27:47","slug":"aon-ebrd-expand-ukraine-war-risk-facility-to-us168m-as-ms-amlin-adds-capacity","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/aon-ebrd-expand-ukraine-war-risk-facility-to-us168m-as-ms-amlin-adds-capacity\/","title":{"rendered":"Aon, EBRD expand Ukraine war-risk facility to US$168m as MS Amlin adds capacity"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"mp_wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-excerpt\">\n    <p>Aon and the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) have expanded the Ukraine Recovery and Reconstruction Guarantee Facility (URGF) to US$168 million from US$123 million, according to ...<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-message\">\n    <div class=\"mepr-wrapper\">\n<p>To continue reading the full article and get full access to the InsuranceAsia News platform, please enquire about a subscription.<\/p>\n<p>Your company may already have a corporate license in place.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mepr-button-wrap\">\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/subscribe\/\">Enquire Now<\/a><\/p>\n<div>OR<\/div>\n<p>      <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/register\/free-trial\/\" class=\"mepr_product_link mepr-product-link-63661\">Take a Free Trial<\/a>\n        <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Already a Subscriber? Please <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/login\/\">Login<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-login-form-wrap\">\n      <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Lloyd&#8217;s carrier, the scheme\u2019s first reinsurer when it launched in March 2025, has lifted its support to US$145m, while two more Ukrainian insurers join.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11026,"featured_media":230874,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"companies_category":[308,513],"subject":[286],"line_of_business"