life-re-seals-second-japan-structured-reinsurance-deal-of-2026","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/pacific-life-re-seals-second-japan-structured-reinsurance-deal-of-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Pacific Life Re seals second Japan structured reinsurance deal of 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"mp_wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-excerpt\">\n    <p>Pacific Life Re has completed a structured reinsurance transaction with an unnamed Japanese life insurer, its second such deal in the Japanese market in 2026.\nThe transaction was designed to improve t...<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-message\">\n    <div class=\"mepr-wrapper\">\n<p>To continue reading the full article and get full access to the InsuranceAsia News platform, please enquire about a subscription.<\/p>\n<p>Your company may already have a corporate license in place.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mepr-button-wrap\">\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/subscribe\/\">Enquire Now<\/a><\/p>\n<div>OR<\/div>\n<p>      <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/register\/free-trial\/\" class=\"mepr_product_link mepr-product-link-63661\">Take a Free Trial<\/a>\n        <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Already a Subscriber? Please <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/login\/\">Login<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-login-form-wrap\">\n      <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The transaction with an unnamed \u2018leading life insurer\u2019 is designed to optimise capital efficiency under the new ESR framework.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6035,"featured_media":203028,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"companies_category":[691],"subject":[489,865],"line_of_business":[],"topic":[],"coauthors":[534],"class_list":["post-230863","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standa