3661\">Take a Free Trial<\/a>\n        <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Already a Subscriber? Please <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/login\/\">Login<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-login-form-wrap\">\n      <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Urban flooding can be intensely local, with a cloudburst overwhelming drainage, inundating basements, and knocking out transport, utilities, and businesses without the dramatic footprint of a major typhoon.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5714,"featured_media":230677,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"companies_category":[],"subject":[190,265],"line_of_business":[],"topic":[],"coauthors":[553],"class_list":["post-230633","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","post_category-opinion","country-asia-pacific","subject-climate","subject-flooding"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.6 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Barcelona floods are a wake-up call on urban flood risk<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"The key resource for accurate, insightful and reliable coverage of Asia\u2019s insurance and reinsurance market.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/barcelona-floods-are-a-wake-up-call-on-urban-flood-risk\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Barcelona floods are a wake-up call on urban flood risk\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The key resource for accurate, insightful and reliable coverage of Asia\u2019s insurance and reinsurance market.\" \/>\n<