epr-unauthorized-excerpt\">\n    <p>Lloyd\u2019s Asia will join the Global Asia Insurance Partnership (GAIP) as a supporting partner, bringing a specialist (re)insurance market perspective to the tripartite platform\u2019s efforts to address prot...<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-message\">\n    <div class=\"mepr-wrapper\">\n<p>To continue reading the full article and get full access to the InsuranceAsia News platform, please enquire about a subscription.<\/p>\n<p>Your company may already have a corporate license in place.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mepr-button-wrap\">\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/subscribe\/\">Enquire Now<\/a><\/p>\n<div>OR<\/div>\n<p>      <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/register\/free-trial\/\" class=\"mepr_product_link mepr-product-link-63661\">Take a Free Trial<\/a>\n        <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Already a Subscriber? Please <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/login\/\">Login<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-login-form-wrap\">\n      <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Lloyd&#8217;s Asia will contribute its specialist expertise to the platform to address protection gaps and strengthen resilience against complex, evolving risks in Asia.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":10954,"featured_media":230803,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"companies_category":[],"subject":[],"line_of_business":[],"topic":[],"coauthors":[877],"class_list":["post-230810","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","industry_segments-industry-associations","industry_segments-insurers","country-asia-pacific"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.6 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Lloyd&#039;s Asia joins GAIP as supporting partner<\/title>\n<