\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/?p=230716"},"modified":"2026-10-11T21:28:05","modified_gmt":"2026-10-11T13:28:05","slug":"the-hartford-targets-apac-growth-with-singapore-energy-launch-in-q1-2027","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/the-hartford-targets-apac-growth-with-singapore-energy-launch-in-q1-2027\/","title":{"rendered":"The Hartford targets APAC growth with Singapore energy launch in Q1 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"mp_wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-excerpt\">\n    <p>The Hartford is preparing to launch new energy solutions from Singapore in the first quarter of next year as Asia remains one of the most attractive long-term specialty markets for the insurer, Carl B...<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-message\">\n    <div class=\"mepr-wrapper\">\n<p>To continue reading the full article and get full access to the InsuranceAsia News platform, please enquire about a subscription.<\/p>\n<p>Your company may already have a corporate license in place.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mepr-button-wrap\">\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/subscribe\/\">Enquire Now<\/a><\/p>\n<div>OR<\/div>\n<p>      <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/register\/free-trial\/\" class=\"mepr_product_link mepr-product-link-63661\">Take a Free Trial<\/a>\n        <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Already a Subscriber? Please <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/login\/\">Login<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-login-form-wrap\">\n      <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Carl Bach, head of international business, sees an \u2018abundance of opportunity&#8217; in all the markets the carrier trades in the region as it continues to expand specialty capabilities and roll out an automated quoting tool.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9598,"featured_media":230751,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_ch